    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d9edca1d07ab7ba2ef03aea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『——谢谢！\n我是热爱运动，用闪耀的汗水连接世界的——』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3f1c70c6561d23f014613af8bd96469e3061008694a9b6cfce82b554442a86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1551a6866a26886ba1da8b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她充分利用了马娘的体能，\n进行着挑战各种运动的直播——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e742176f5166bcf6c114230e77f1fc4088fc86e0ac9391845bff639315157249",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb615a0630bc3e9bcca3435",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挑战各种运动，并以其高水准的表现\n和始终愉快的运动姿态赢得了人气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd74d49055198e368b8b3b09930deee9f39101913a3f49195d44e235c344834a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb6847afd665bb8eeb4c872",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，得去集合地点了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9024a4e722c1f877592faa84da27eccc5ce530f8763ce4d723ddd0991b99e18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:308ecf67ce268478785c9bca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，学园的马娘们\n也在一边观看艾尔菲的直播，\n一边展开热烈的讨论——",
      "source_fingerprint": "560e1291944572d4951ac8e3ec801d78e6a4f3d54f285619582ddb1048016ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c135f20c829326ef7d80df76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
