      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b252a435d25f89c0335e32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "各位！感谢大家\n在百忙之中聚集在一起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77dee08c0c9c70c653c9cd5ec0411ccf58383cd669f82a23883c345c7c90afe7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e3730c878e022685b1c378d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学园的全体训练员都在体育馆集合，\n看着台上的秋川理事长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0704bcdf2c990e76d32cdb6772496574e2ab0ff6071ff8e05e6916ae77fec3ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
